--- /dev/null
+++ b/releasenotes/notes/fix-deserialize-optional-type-223b5423e31e4950.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+---
+fixes:
+  - |
+    Fix `deserialize_type` so that types like `typing.Optional[str]` can be deserialized again.
+    Previously, deserializing a single-argument generic such as `Optional[str]` raised a `TypeError`
+    because the argument was passed as a 1-tuple instead of the bare type, and `Optional[Union[int, str]]`
+    (which serializes with a `NoneType` argument) raised a `DeserializationError`. This fixes
+    deserialization of components like `BranchJoiner` when initialized with an `Optional` type.
